OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested on suspicion of child
OL,4,Aneglect after safety concerns at
OL,5,Anursery
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo people have been arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of child neglect at a
OL,9,Fnow-closed nursery, police have said.
OL,11,FThe arrests relating to Greenfields
OL,12,FNursery in Bridge Street, Blackwood,
OL,13,Ffollowed reports of health and safety
OL,14,Fconcerns from Caerphilly council.
OL,16,FGwent Police said a 49-year-old man
OL,17,Ffrom Cardiff and a 29-year-old woman
OL,18,Ffrom the Caerphilly area had been
OL,19,Freleased on conditional bail pending
OL,20,Ffurther police enquiries.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
