OL,3,GNEWSATwo arrested on suspicion of child
OL,4,Aneglect after safety concerns at
OL,5,Anursery
OL,6,
OL,7,FDet Insp Gavin Wilkes said: "We
OL,8,Funderstand that allegations of this
OL,9,Fnature are upsetting and working with
OL,10,Fpartner agencies, we are conducting a
OL,11,Fthorough investigation."
